3. Add a favicon to your website
A favicon is the small icon displayed beside your website title in the browser tab.

Educated - Blue Graduation Cap Icon Png, Transparent Png - 981x688(#236225) - PngFind
 
Example favicon design

You can use a small graduation cap icon for your student projects.

Follow these steps:

Create or download a small PNG icon.

Rename the image to favicon.png.

Put it in the same folder as your HTML files.

Add this code inside the <head> section:

<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="favicon.png">
4. Correct project folder structure
Keep your files organized like this:

HTML-Assignments

registration.html

job-application.html

marksheet.html

favicon.png

style.css

Important: If your CSS is written inside a <style> tag in each HTML file, you don't need a separate style.css file. Only use the CSS link if you have created that file.

